            "question": "Please note",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Please take your time to watch the video before you start taking your impressions.</strong></p><p>Further information:</p><ul><li>The impression material is not suitable for consumption.</li><li>Please do not swallow.</li><li>Avoid contact of the impression material with the eyes. In case of contact, rinse your eyes with clean water.</li><li>If possible, breathe only through your nose while taking impressions.</li><li>If you have loose teeth, consult your dentist first.</li><li>Use at your own risk.</li></ul>"
