          "settings": {
            "question": "Contents of impression kit",
            "answer": "<p>In your impression kit, you will find:</p><ul><li><strong>Impression trays</strong></li><li><strong>Yellow and white putties</strong></li><li><strong>Double syringe with mixing tips</strong></li></ul><p>The material is enough for two attempts per jaw. If you ordered veneers for the upper or lower teeth, you'll have material for two attempts in your kit. If you ordered veneers for both the upper and lower teeth, there should be enough material for four attempts.</p>"
